    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "The & Partnership (rebranded T&Pm after merging with mSix&Partners in March 2024) is a global full-service advertising and media network, London-headquartered (Charlotte Building, 17 Gresse Street), backed by WPP and GroupM. Approx 1,900 people across 45 offices on four continents; over $1.2bn in billings; largest client is Toyota. Core offer spans campaign creative, film and TV production, media planning and buying, brand strategy, data and analytics, and AI-powered content. This is a large ad network that commissions and directs work at scale rather than a small hands-on execution studio. Country field shows primary markets only; full footprint covers ~40 countries across EMEA, Americas, APAC. Size corrected to 100+ from erroneous pre-filled 11-40. Open question filed on fit for the blackbook.",
